From 7fb878b810bc143db2adc1ddae72009a9a001534 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:41:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER (tools 0153): the code a jump went to gets its own
 background; big back / forward buttons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1003: "你用事件轉跳到程式碼時 我希望你用不同底色 標出轉跳到的程式碼"
- openTarget -> markJump: the whole function the line starts (cppstub.funcRange:
  the first '{' within 30 lines, no ';' before it, braces matched with comments
  / strings masked; C++ and JS) or else that line (.dfm: the line) gets a
  whole-line background + a scroll bar mark, theme colour
  ht9045Designer.jumpTargetBackground (contributes.colors, dark / light / HC).
  One at a time: the next jump moves it; put back when the tab is shown again.

EastSun 1003: "可以轉跳我上次程式碼位置的按鈕 做大一點讓我方便點 也加個轉跳到上個程式碼後 可以轉跳到下個程式碼的按鈕"
- ht9045Designer.navBack / navForward = workbench.action.navigateBack / Forward
  (VS Code's place history, Alt+Left / Alt+Right): two status bar buttons with
  words at the far left ("← 回上一個位置", "下一個位置 →"), always there; arrows on
  the editor title bar when canNavigateBack / canNavigateForward.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (lib 184: funcRange; extension 227: the mark, the
buttons); real VS Code 156/159 (the 3 known stale checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
